  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activities for childhood cancer survivors</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We organise several activities for childhood cancer survivors. Childhood cancers survivors often face physical and mental late effects. The activities empowers them in their lives after the childhood cancer. Our activities are a form of peer support that offers them a possibility to exchange experiences, learn from each other and also have fun together. This empowers them to regain control over their lives. The activities are: - camps  - sport activities  - social meet-ups - pub quizzes</narrative>
  </description>
